  Lines:
  - Id: prologue_1
    Speaker: 0
    LocalizationKey: dlg.prologue_1
    Text: "\xC0s vinte e tr\xEAs e quarenta, os primeiros gritos vieram dos hangares. O sargento de servi\xE7o disse que era treinamento."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 3
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 0
    MissionId: 
    ObjectiveIndex: -1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 90
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: prologue
    Segments: []
  - Id: prologue_2
    Speaker: 0
    LocalizationKey: dlg.prologue_2
    Text: "\xC0 meia-noite e quinze, a base parou de responder ao comando regional. Pouco depois, a conten\xE7\xE3o do laborat\xF3rio come\xE7ou a falhar."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 3
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 0
    MissionId: 
    ObjectiveIndex: -1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 90
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: prologue
    Segments: []
  - Id: prologue_3
    Speaker: 0
    LocalizationKey: dlg.prologue_3
    Text: "O \xFAltimo relat\xF3rio falava de um composto chamado Aurora. Nenhuma equipe de resgate veio confirmar o que aconteceu."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 3
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 0
    MissionId: 
    ObjectiveIndex: -1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 90
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: prologue
    Segments: []
  - Id: prologue_4
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.prologue_4
    Text: "...al\xF4? Algu\xE9m na escuta? Aqui \xE9 o Tenente Duarte, Controle Aurora. Se tem algu\xE9m vivo a\xED dentro, responda."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 3
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 0
    MissionId: 
    ObjectiveIndex: -1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 90
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: prologue
    Segments: []
  - Id: prologue_5
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.prologue_5
    Text: "A comunica\xE7\xE3o est\xE1 inst\xE1vel, e eu n\xE3o sei quanto tempo a gente tem."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 3
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 0
    MissionId: 
    ObjectiveIndex: -1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 90
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: prologue
    Segments: []
  - Id: prologue_6
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.prologue_6
    Text: "Pegue uma arma e saia do p\xE1tio. Tem alguma coisa se movendo entre os alojamentos."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 3
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 0
    MissionId: 
    ObjectiveIndex: -1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 90
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: prologue
    Segments: []
  - Id: radio_wake
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.radio_wake
    Text: "...est\xE1 me ouvindo? Aqui \xE9 o Tenente Duarte. Se voc\xEA est\xE1 vivo, pegue uma arma. Eles v\xEAm atr\xE1s do barulho."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 2
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 0
    MissionId: 
    ObjectiveIndex: -1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 20
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: prologue_6
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: fc_armed
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.fc_armed
    Text: "Boa. Agora voc\xEA tem com o que se defender. D\xEA uma olhada em volta, mas sem pressa."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 1
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 2
    MissionId: m_first_contact
    ObjectiveIndex: 0
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 10
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: fc_area
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.fc_area
    Text: Estou ouvindo movimento perto do seu sinal. Muito movimento. Prepare-se.
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 2
    Interrupt: 1
    Trigger: 2
    MissionId: m_first_contact
    ObjectiveIndex: 1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 20
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: fc_done
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.fc_done
    Text: "Voc\xEA ainda est\xE1 de p\xE9. Isso j\xE1 \xE9 mais do que a maioria aqui conseguiu."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 1
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 3
    MissionId: m_first_contact
    ObjectiveIndex: -1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 10
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: radio_power
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.radio_power
    Text: "Estou vendo uma queda no gerador do setor noroeste. Se a energia cair de vez, os port\xF5es de seguran\xE7a param. V\xE1 at\xE9 a sala de m\xE1quinas."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 2
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 0
    MissionId: 
    ObjectiveIndex: -1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 20
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: gen_found
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.gen_found
    Text: "Achei a origem da falha. Tiraram dois fus\xEDveis do painel. Devem estar espalhados pela base."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 1
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 2
    MissionId: m_generator
    ObjectiveIndex: 0
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 10
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: gen_fuse1
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.gen_fuse1
    Text: "\xD3timo, um j\xE1 foi. Falta mais um. Cuidado: estou ouvindo movimento perto de voc\xEA."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 1
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 5
    MissionId: m_generator
    ObjectiveIndex: -1
    ItemId: fuse
    ItemCount: 1
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 10
    RequireMissionActive: 1
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: gen_fuse2
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.gen_fuse2
    Text: "Os dois fus\xEDveis. Volte para o painel e instale."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 1
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 5
    MissionId: m_generator
    ObjectiveIndex: -1
    ItemId: fuse
    ItemCount: 2
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 10
    RequireMissionActive: 1
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: gen_power
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.gen_power
    Text: "Energia restaurada... espere. O barulho atraiu alguma coisa. Segure a posi\xE7\xE3o at\xE9 o gerador estabilizar!"
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 3
    Interrupt: 1
    Trigger: 2
    MissionId: m_generator
    ObjectiveIndex: 3
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 20
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: gen_done
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.gen_done
    Text: "O gerador est\xE1 est\xE1vel. Boa. Respire um pouco, enquanto pode."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 1
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 3
    MissionId: m_generator
    ObjectiveIndex: -1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 10
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: radio_signal
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.radio_signal
    Text: "...tchhh... esta\xE7\xE3o de comunica\xE7\xE3o... m\xF3dulo... repetindo... protocolo... tchhh..."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 2
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 0
    MissionId: 
    ObjectiveIndex: -1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 20
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: sig_station
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.sig_station
    Text: "Essa esta\xE7\xE3o \xE9 a nossa chance de ouvir o que o comando est\xE1 dizendo. Falta o m\xF3dulo de r\xE1dio."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 1
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 2
    MissionId: m_signal
    ObjectiveIndex: 0
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 10
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: sig_module
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.sig_module
    Text: "Achou o m\xF3dulo. Instale no console e vamos ver o que sai da\xED."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 1
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 2
    MissionId: m_signal
    ObjectiveIndex: 1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 10
    RequireMissionActive: 1
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: radio_signal_ok
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.radio_signal_ok
    Text: "Sinal limpo! Escute... o comando n\xE3o vem nos buscar. A ordem \xE9 conter a base. Conter a gente."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 2
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 0
    MissionId: 
    ObjectiveIndex: -1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 20
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: radio_armory
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.radio_armory
    Text: "O arsenal est\xE1 trancado por cart\xE3o. O intendente deixou um com o oficial de dia, perto das torres."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 2
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 0
    MissionId: 
    ObjectiveIndex: -1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 20
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: arm_card
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.arm_card
    Text: "\xC9 esse cart\xE3o. O leitor fica na porta do arsenal."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 1
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 2
    MissionId: m_armory
    ObjectiveIndex: 0
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 10
    RequireMissionActive: 1
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: arm_done
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.arm_done
    Text: "Com isso d\xE1 para aguentar mais uma noite. Talvez."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 1
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 3
    MissionId: m_armory
    ObjectiveIndex: -1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 10
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: radio_e07
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.radio_e07
    Text: "Alguma coisa enorme rompeu a conten\xE7\xE3o do laborat\xF3rio. O Experimento 07. Fa\xE7a ele bater em algo pesado e acerte quando cambalear."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 3
    Interrupt: 1
    Trigger: 0
    MissionId: 
    ObjectiveIndex: -1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 20
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: radio_e07_dead
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.radio_e07_dead
    Text: "Voc\xEA derrubou o 07... Isso n\xE3o foi acidente. Foi um teste. E voc\xEA passou."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 2
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 0
    MissionId: 
    ObjectiveIndex: -1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 20
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: radio_tower
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.radio_tower
    Text: "A torre de vigil\xE2ncia tem refletores. A luz segura essas coisas por um tempo. Religue a alimenta\xE7\xE3o dela."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 2
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 0
    MissionId: 
    ObjectiveIndex: -1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 20
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: tow_lights
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.tow_lights
    Text: "Refletores acesos! Agora eles v\xE3o querer ver o que \xE9. Defenda a torre."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 2
    Interrupt: 1
    Trigger: 2
    MissionId: m_tower
    ObjectiveIndex: 2
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 20
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: tow_done
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.tow_done
    Text: "Consegui ver a base pelas c\xE2meras da torre. Est\xE1 pior do que eu pensava."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 1
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 3
    MissionId: m_tower
    ObjectiveIndex: -1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 10
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: radio_lab
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.radio_lab
    Text: "O laborat\xF3rio fica no setor sudeste. Os registros de l\xE1 devem explicar tudo. Recupere a caixa-preta."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 2
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 0
    MissionId: 
    ObjectiveIndex: -1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 20
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: lab_enter
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.lab_enter
    Text: "Voc\xEA est\xE1 dentro do laborat\xF3rio. Fique atento: foi daqui que tudo saiu."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 2
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 2
    MissionId: m_blackbox
    ObjectiveIndex: 0
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 20
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: lab_docs
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.lab_docs
    Text: "Valen\xE7a... eu conhe\xE7o esse nome. Era ele quem assinava as ordens do Setor 4."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 1
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 2
    MissionId: m_blackbox
    ObjectiveIndex: 1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 10
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: lab_box
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.lab_box
    Text: "A caixa-preta fala de um protocolo de queima \xE0s quatro da manh\xE3. Eles v\xE3o apagar a base inteira. Com a gente dentro."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 3
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 3
    MissionId: m_blackbox
    ObjectiveIndex: -1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 20
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: radio_alarm
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.radio_alarm
    Text: "O alarme disparou sozinho e est\xE1 chamando a horda inteira. Desligue os pain\xE9is!"
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 2
    Interrupt: 1
    Trigger: 0
    MissionId: 
    ObjectiveIndex: -1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 20
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: alarm_done
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.alarm_done
    Text: "Sil\xEAncio de novo. Ou o mais perto disso que d\xE1 para ter aqui."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 0
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 3
    MissionId: m_alarm
    ObjectiveIndex: -1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 10
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: radio_supply
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.radio_supply
    Text: "Tem um dep\xF3sito de suprimentos no fundo da base. Abrir aquilo vai fazer barulho, mas est\xE1 cheio de muni\xE7\xE3o."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 0
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 0
    MissionId: 
    ObjectiveIndex: -1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 10
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: radio_gates
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.radio_gates
    Text: "Os port\xF5es est\xE3o abertos. Feche todos e reforce as passagens. Cada minuto conta."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 1
    Interrupt: 0
    Trigger: 0
    MissionId: 
    ObjectiveIndex: -1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 10
    RequireMissionActive: 0
    SkipIfPlayed: 
    Group: 
    Segments: []
  - Id: radio_contain
    Speaker: 1
    LocalizationKey: dlg.radio_contain
    Text: "Os dutos de ventila\xE7\xE3o est\xE3o abrindo! Feche as v\xE1lvulas na ordem certa, ou a base inteira vira um ninho."
    Clip: {fileID: 0}
    Duration: 0
    Priority: 3
    Interrupt: 1
    Trigger: 0
    MissionId: 
    ObjectiveIndex: -1
    ItemId: 
    ItemCount: 0
    Once: 1
    Cooldown: 0
    MaxQueueTime: 20
